{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39708","headline":"酬徐正字夤 · 黄滔","name":"酬徐正字夤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已免蹉跎负岁华，敢辞霜鬓雪呈花。\n名从两榜考昇第，官自三台追起家。\n疋马有期归辇毂，故山无计恋桑麻。\n莫言蓬阁从容久，披处终知金在砂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}